WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:03,970
What's going on

2
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:06,140
The breakfast room on the second floor will be open for breakfast tomorrow morning

3
00:00:06,140 --> 00:00:07,060
if you need

4
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:09,180
You can come and order food between five and eight o'clock

5
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:10,260
OK thank you

6
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:12,340
Is there any breakfast left in the morning?

7
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:14,060
We didn't eat enough. We want to buy more.

8
00:00:15,270 --> 00:00:16,230
it's true

9
00:00:16,230 --> 00:00:17,630
Am I not dreaming?

10
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:20,150
Fresh juice, soft and waxy texture

11
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:22,350
It's true. It's true that Xiao Long Bao has been eating food for so many years.

12
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:24,190
I've never eaten anything so fresh again

13
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:27,710
There is actually a clean, non-polluted water source in the room, and you can even take a shower. How can you be a deserter?

14
00:00:27,710 --> 00:00:28,870
This is obviously heaven

15
00:00:28,870 --> 00:00:30,070
Sorry, two guests

16
00:00:30,070 --> 00:00:31,110
Food in the breakfast machine

17
00:00:31,110 --> 00:00:32,430
Already bought by other customers

18
00:00:32,590 --> 00:00:36,070
However, the breakfast room next to it will provide breakfast tomorrow morning. If you need it, you can go there and buy it.

19
00:00:36,070 --> 00:00:36,990
How come there just isn’t?

20
00:00:36,990 --> 00:00:41,120
It must be because the boss dislikes our purchase.

21
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:42,200
But we really didn’t have enough to eat

22
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:43,440
Can't you be accommodating?

23
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:44,480
Anything to eat is fine

24
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:45,880
Instant noodles are served in Shuangren Street

25
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:47,480
The water dispenser downstairs also has hot water

26
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:49,480
However, hot water requires one point.

27
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:51,040
You two can make do with each other, but
